# Valgrind suppressions for pcapstat.
# fontconfig (loaded by cairo's toy font API) keeps a process-wide config
# cache built while parsing its XML config via libexpat; some of it is not
# reachable at exit. Scope: the allocator's *immediate* caller must be code
# inside libfontconfig, so allocations made by project code never match.
# Derived from `valgrind --gen-suppressions=all` (fontconfig 2.x / expat).
{
   fontconfig-config-cache
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite,indirect,possible,reachable
   fun:*alloc
   obj:*/libfontconfig.so*
}
